# Compiled test binaries, which `go test -c` leaves behind.
*.test

# Profiling output.
*.out
*.prof

# Editor and OS noise.
.DS_Store

# Differential-test corpora. These are third-party material — production
# stylesheets and rule sets, plus the Saxon output they are diffed against —
# so they are not redistributed here. The tests that use them skip cleanly
# when the directory is absent; see "Testing" in the README for how to point
# the suite at your own corpus.
# Both spellings on purpose. "/testdata/" matches a directory and nothing
# else, so a *symlink* named testdata is not ignored by it — which is how a
# worktree's symlink to the real corpora was once committed, and then written
# over the real directory when that commit was reverted. "/testdata" matches
# whatever the name refers to.
/testdata
/testdata/
